#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Application functions for optimization {#application-functions-for-"
"optimization}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following quantum functions package the full optimization workflow, from"
" problem mapping through hardware execution and post-processing, behind a "
"managed interface. Rather than building and tuning your own circuits, you "
"provide a problem definition, such as an objective function, a graph, or an "
"industry-specific input like asset price data, and the function returns an "
"optimized solution. These functions address optimization problems across "
"domains, including unconstrained and constrained binary optimization, "
"portfolio rebalancing in finance, and resource allocation problems defined "
"on graphs.\n"
msgstr ""

